==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{m|gmh|offen}}, {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|offan|lang=goh}}, {{term|ofan|lang=goh}}, {{term|ophan|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*upanaz}}. Cognate with {{etyl|nds|-}} {{term|open|lang=nds}}, {{term|apen|lang=nds}}, {{etyl|nl|-}} {{term|open|lang=nl}}, {{etyl|en|-}} {{term|open|lang=en}}, {{etyl|da|-}} {{term|åben|lang=da}}, {{etyl|sv|-}} {{term|öppen|lang=sv}}. Related to {{term|auf|lang=de}}.

